We prove by induction on $k$ that every initial segment of the sequence, $a_{0}, a_{1}, \ldots, a_{k}$, consists of the following elements (counted with multiplicity, and not necessarily in order), for some $\ell \geqslant 0$ with $2 \ell \leqslant k+1$ :

$$
