$$
where $\beta=v / c$ and $v$ is the velocity of emitter (the ${ }^{58} \mathrm{Ni}$ nucleus). Taking the calculated value of the ${ }^{58} \mathrm{Ni}$ velocity (equation 29 ) we get:
