Substituting in (16), we obtain:

$$
\left(\frac{\mathrm{d} \Omega}{\mathrm{d} t}\right)^{3}=\left(\frac{96}{5}\right)^{3} \frac{\Omega^{11}}{c^{15}} G^{5} \mu^{3} M^{2} \equiv\left(\frac{96}{5}\right)^{3} \frac{\Omega^{11}}{c^{15}}\left(G M_{\mathrm{c}}\right)^{5}
